  body: "# Period of a capital disregard\n\nThe duration and possible extension of a disregard considered
    separately from whether the capital qualifies for it. The captured chapter lists several duration
    categories; applicability must be checked.\n\nProject-authored interpretation awaiting specialist
    review. Evidence: [DMG 84355–84356, PDF page 36](https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a5e38bb8b7e4fa537e693d5/dmg-ch84.pdf#page=36);
